      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْمَرٌ</span></b>  [<i>Marble:</i> or <i>alabaster:</i> in the present
day, more commonly the latter:] <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُخَامٌ</span>: (S,
A, Mgh, K:) i. e., <i>a kind of soft white stone:</i>
(Mgh:) or <i>a hard kind of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رخام</span>: (TA:) or <i>a
kind of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رخام</span>, <i>but harder and clearer</i> [<i>than what
is commonly so called</i>]. (Msb.) ＝   
